<section class="section-tight rule-top" aria-label="Policy">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Freeland Marketing &amp; Entertainment ("we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you share with us. Here is how we collect, use and safeguard your information when you visit freelandme.com and use our services.</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <h3>Information you provide</h3>
      <p>When you apply for a Growth Roadmap, apply as an agency partner, run the instant site check, or write to us, we may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name and business name</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Phone number, if you choose to give it</li>
        <li>Your store or website address</li>
        <li>Your monthly online sales range, main sales channel and role (Growth Roadmap application)</li>
        <li>Your agency name, website, number of clients and services (partner application)</li>
        <li>Information about your business and marketing goals</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>The Growth Roadmap and partner application forms</h3>
      <p>When you send an application, the answers you gave are stored with our hosting provider, Netlify, and delivered to Kevin by email. Along with your answers we store the page you first landed on, the page and button you used to reach the form, and any campaign tags (UTM values) in the link that brought you here. To limit abuse we also keep a hashed form of your IP address, which we use only to count how many applications come from one connection.</p>

      <h3>Scheduling a call</h3>
      <p>Calls are booked through Microsoft Bookings on Kevin's Microsoft 365 calendar. When you pick a time, Microsoft collects the details you enter there, such as your name, email address and the time you chose, and sends the confirmation and reminders. Microsoft's privacy statement is at <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement" rel="noopener">privacy.microsoft.com</a>.</p>

      <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
      <p>When you visit our website, we automatically collect certain information through cookies and similar technologies:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics 4.</strong> We use Google Analytics (tracking ID: {{ site.ga4 }}) to understand how visitors use our website. This includes pages visited, time spent on site, referring sources, device type and general geographic location. Google Analytics uses cookies to collect this data. You can opt out by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-Out Browser Add-On</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>hCaptcha.</strong> Our forms may use hCaptcha to prevent spam. hCaptcha may collect certain browser and device data to verify you are human. Their privacy policy is at <a href="https://www.hcaptcha.com/privacy" rel="noopener">hcaptcha.com/privacy</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use your information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To review your application and prepare your Growth Roadmap</li>
        <li>To respond to your inquiries and schedule calls</li>
        <li>To provide the marketing and automation services you request</li>
        <li>To send follow-up communications related to your inquiry</li>
        <li>To improve our website and services based on usage patterns</li>
        <li>To prevent fraud and abuse</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell, rent or share your personal information with third parties for their marketing purposes.</p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>We use the following services that may process your data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Netlify.</strong> Website hosting and storage of applications. Their privacy policy is at <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" rel="noopener">netlify.com/privacy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Microsoft 365 and Microsoft Bookings.</strong> Email and call scheduling.</li>
        <li><strong>n8n.</strong> Routes form submissions to our inbox and sends the automatic reply.</li>
        <li><strong>Web3Forms.</strong> Delivers the existing-client onboarding form and acts as backup delivery for roadmap and partner applications. Their privacy policy is at <a href="https://web3forms.com/privacy" rel="noopener">web3forms.com/privacy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics.</strong> Website analytics. See Google's privacy policy at <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>hCaptcha.</strong> Spam prevention on forms.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>Our website uses cookies primarily through Google Analytics to analyze website traffic. Cookies are small text files stored on your device. You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect your experience on our site but will not prevent you from using it.</p>

      <h2>Data security</h2>
      <p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information, including HTTPS encryption, security headers and restricted access to personal data. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>We keep your personal information only as long as we need it for the purposes listed above, or as the law requires. Applications and form submissions are kept for the duration of our business relationship and a reasonable period thereafter.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access the personal information we hold about you</li>
        <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your personal information</li>
        <li>Opt out of analytics tracking</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>

      <h2>California residents (CCPA)</h2>
      <p>If you are a California resident, you have the right to know what personal information we collect, request deletion of your data, and opt out of the sale of personal information. We do not sell personal information. To submit a request, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>Our website and services are not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe we have collected information from a child, please contact us immediately.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this page</h2>
      <p>We may update this page from time to time. Changes will be posted here with an updated "Last updated" date.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about privacy or how we handle your data: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
    </div>
